WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.646
In Shifts, open Settings, then Calendar
Sync.

00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:08.259
Allow Calendar access if you want the app
to create and update events.

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:11.377
Choose the destination for this workplace.

00:00:12.227 --> 00:00:14.696
Here we're using a dedicated workplace
calendar.

00:00:15.596 --> 00:00:18.217
Read the summary before tapping Save
destination.

00:00:19.417 --> 00:00:22.568
Changing the destination can move events
the app already manages.

00:00:23.468 --> 00:00:25.639
Wait for the result, then check your
calendar.

00:00:26.889 --> 00:00:29.354
Include Shift Info is separate from private
notes.

00:00:30.204 --> 00:00:33.193
Leave it off if you don't want that extra
shift information in events.

00:00:34.093 --> 00:00:36.173
Visits doesn't have this Calendar Sync
setting.

00:00:37.373 --> 00:00:40.301
The written guide covers the other choices
about what leaves the app.
